Firstly, to provide a high level of answer relevance, we will employ our RAG approach to generate answers grounded in the organization's own validated documents, including care protocols, HAS recommendations, internal procedures, applicable regulatory texts, and internal guides. This ensures that the information provided is not only relevant but also contextually appropriate for the healthcare environment.

Secondly, to support medical coding for activity reporting (PMSI, ICD-10), our solution can utilize its structured extraction capabilities. This feature enables the assistant to help with tasks like assisting PMSI/ICD-10 coding from clinical notes, thereby streamlining the process and reducing potential errors in coding.

